{"product_id":"smok-rpm-25w-leather-pod-system","title":"SMOK RPM 25W Leather Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK RPM 25W Pod System, featuring an integrated 900mAh battery, 5-25W output range, and receives support from the LP1 coils series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-25w-empty-replacement-pods\" title=\"RPM 25W Replacement Pods\"\u003eSMOK RPM 25 Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK LP1 Replacement Coils\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOffering up to 25W of adjustable power, the RPM 25W Pod System offers plenty of delightful vaping throughout the day, and can be recharged via Type-C USB Port. Equipped with a 2mL pod, the RPM 25W utilizes coils from the LP1 Meshed MTL Coil Series to deliver outstanding vapor and flavor at the press of a button and is outfitted with an adjustable airflow control ring.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"smok rpm 25w infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/products\/SMOK_RPM_25W_Pod_Systems_-_Infographic_copy-min.jpg?v=1681418592\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK RPM 25W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110mm by 23.2mm by 20.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 900mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 1.5-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Adjustment Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Ring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm LP1 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 RPM 25W Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 RPM 25W Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm LP1 Mesh MTL Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673692610615,"sku":"69d25f6c39c7f","price":4600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_rpm_25w_-_pod_kit_-_all_colors_1-min.png?v=1747875590","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-25w-leather-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




